Usage: [options] [additional arguments]

Options:
 -p, --package-only     Skip compilation and build only the packages.
 -d, --docker-compile   Compile inside a Docker container instead of native Gradle build.
 -h, --help             Display this help message and exit.
 -r release-name        Specify one or more releases to build packages for. Supported values:
                          - resolute, noble   (Debian packages)
                          - rpm-el9, rpm-el10 (Red Hat packages)
                        Example: -r resolute -r rpm-el9

Options can be used individually or in combination.
If provided, options must precede any additional arguments.
Additional arguments are passed on to compile_code.sh
